{"id":"n60630-1-22","stage":1,"title":"날씨 · 天气","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60630-1-22-1","ko":"이번 주말부터 날씨가 풀린대.","zh":"听说从这周末开始天气就回暖了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"주말부터","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말부터","audio":"/audio/1ac500919f6ce1cdee59.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"풀린대.","meaning":"回暖，融化","explanation":"풀리다：回暖，融化；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"풀리다","audio":"/audio/aba31e511b1563e0e599.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62314","senseId":"12","lemma":"풀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풀린대","audio":"/audio/8f2efcf1b88fb03e2e96.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"aba31e511b1563e0","term":"풀리다","zh":"回暖，融化","audio":"/audio/aba31e511b1563e0e599.mp3","entryId":"62314","definition":"冰块化掉或寒冷的天气变暖。","pronunciation":["풀리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/59591a8239b9d2f91d24.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60630-1-22-2","ko":"그럼 이제 좀 따뜻해지겠구나. 두꺼운 옷을 넣고 얇은 옷을 꺼내야겠어.","zh":"那就能暖和些了。该把厚衣服收起来，拿出薄衣服了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"따뜻해지겠구나.","meaning":"暖和；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"따뜻하다：暖和；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"따뜻하다","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57297","senseId":"1","lemma":"따뜻하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따뜻해지겠구나","audio":"/audio/758135e224c469967862.mp3"}},{"text":"두꺼운","meaning":"厚，深厚","explanation":"두껍다：厚，深厚；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"두껍다","audio":"/audio/d88cffdde7c81578e37e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48277","senseId":"1","lemma":"두껍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두꺼운","audio":"/audio/f0288732272719215fa9.mp3"}},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷을","audio":"/audio/76fa7acf1b0008045d0c.mp3"}},{"text":"넣고","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣고","audio":"/audio/bc9dd322908f47e194c3.mp3"}},{"text":"얇은","meaning":"薄","explanation":"얇다：薄；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"얇다","audio":"/audio/7dbc70519003a2d1bb2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89859","senseId":"1","lemma":"얇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얇은","audio":"/audio/b1b0b78c351d7325592d.mp3"}},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷을","audio":"/audio/76fa7acf1b0008045d0c.mp3"}},{"text":"꺼내야겠어.","meaning":"拿出，掏出，取出","explanation":"꺼내다：拿出，掏出，取出；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"꺼내다","audio":"/audio/eda7321c0e7ec22a3cbc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62265","senseId":"1","lemma":"꺼내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꺼내야겠어","audio":"/audio/6dc27645304a2b96072a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"e4840ad0903352f1","term":"따뜻하다","zh":"暖和","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3","entryId":"57297","definition":"温度适中，不觉得太热，达到心情舒适的程度。","pronunciation":["따뜨타다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"d88cffdde7c81578","term":"두껍다","zh":"厚，深厚","audio":"/audio/d88cffdde7c81578e37e.mp3","entryId":"48277","definition":"扁平物上下两面之间的距离大。","pronunciation":["두껍따"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放进，装进","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个空间里。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"7dbc70519003a2d1","term":"얇다","zh":"薄","audio":"/audio/7dbc70519003a2d1bb2d.mp3","entryId":"89859","definition":"厚度不厚。","pronunciation":["얄ː따"]},{"id":"eda7321c0e7ec22a","term":"꺼내다","zh":"拿出，掏出，取出","audio":"/audio/eda7321c0e7ec22a3cbc.mp3","entryId":"62265","definition":"把里面的东西拿到外面。","pronunciation":["꺼ː내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cf8fc3549bafd91d98dc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.039,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60630","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":47,"sequenceScore":2.0712,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那就能暖和些了。该把厚衣服收起来，拿出薄衣服了。","已经十点多了呢。","听说从这周末开始天气就回暖了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那就能暖和些了。该把厚衣服收起来，拿出薄衣服了。","听说从这周末开始天气就回暖了。","已经十点多了呢。"],"answer":0}]}
